<title>USA: AGISS says president adds COO duties.</title>
<headline>AGISS says president adds COO duties.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>AGISS Corp said on Tuesday its president, Scott Feagan, was named to also serve as chief operating officer.</p>
<p>The company said Feagan previously served as president of CPAD Technologies Inc before working for AGISS, an automated conversion tools company.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
